Z||000000||bcwawright||06-10-2001||05:15 PM||||Is the steering column in an 88GT the same as 86 and 87....I know the steering racks are different but will an 86 or 87 steering column fit my 88GT and hook up to the 88GT steering rack.<BR>Thanks<P>Bruce<BR>88GT||||reg||5
